_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2535,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-11-27T20:29:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:39:31Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":5,"created_at":"2026-03-29T18:57:04Z","updated_at":"2026-04-06T18:09:41Z","closed_at":"2026-04-06T18:07:11Z","assignee":{"login":"QbieShay","id":7917475,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MTc0NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7917475?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay","html_url":"https://github.com/QbieShay","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: v4.7-dev3; v4.7.dev.gh-113509 [375321054]; v4.7.dev.gh-117909 [499756d28]\n- Not Reproducible in: v4.7-dev2; v4.6.2-RC1; and earlier versions.\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.dev3 - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+, Mobile) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1650 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.9186) - AMD Ryzen 7 5700X 8-Core Processor (16 threads) - 31.88 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\n2D and 3D sub emitter particles are not inheriting the parent's velocity, neither using their own, they just stay in their spawn location.\n- Disabling \"Keep Velocity\" makes the sub-particles fallback to their velocity, as expected.\n- Re-enabling keeps using their velocity settings instead of using the parent's.\n- Reopening the editor resets the sub-particles to staying in place.\n\nI tested with Velocity, Gravity and Accelerations, none worked.\n\nThis issue seem to be a regression, as it happens on v4.7-Dev3, but not on v4.7-Dev2 and earlier.\n\nThe problem should be somewhere from PR #113509 and earlier, as that was where I noticed it for the first time.\nI also tested the Artifacts from #117909, but the issue still persists.\n\n### Expected behavior\n\nThe sub-particles should inherit their parent's velocity at the moment they spawn.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nThe reproduction project has the \"main_2d\" and \"main_3d\" scenes that show the issue, even in the editor.\n\nTo test with a new project:\n1) Create a GPU particle (A) with some velocity or acceleration.\n2) Create a GPU particle (B) with visibly different velocity/acceleration.\n3) Make B a Sub Emitter of A.\n4) Enable Process Material > Sub Emitter > Keep Velocity.\n5) B should follow A's velocity, but instead keeps it's own or stays in place.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n~[GPUParticle2D.SubEmitter.Inherit.Velocity.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/26334356/GPUParticle2D.SubEmitter.Inherit.Velocity.zip)~\n\n[GPUParticle.SubEmitter.Inherit.Velocity.v2.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/26415868/GPUParticle.SubEmitter.Inherit.Velocity.v2.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117976/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117976/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}